From 4b0c2d3a74c88dc13d555520c661a7604a6d4d48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:54:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 101/102] SableOS: Sable appearance authority and Display >
 Accent

Host the org.sableos.appearance provider that Sable apps and Sable Start
read for the Sable accent, and add an Accent list next to Dark theme in
Settings > Display.

The system theme stays the single source of light/dark (DESIGN-KF-B):
the provider always reports mode=follow-system and maps an explicit
light/dark write to UiModeManager. Choosing an accent stores it and seeds
the system palette (THEME_CUSTOMIZATION_OVERLAY_PACKAGES, preset color),
so Quick Settings, Settings and SetupWizard follow the same accent.
Writes are limited to Settings and org.sableos.launcher. The pure policy
lives in SableAppearancePolicy.
